    "Details": "A variant of the standard Shootist ST-8A, the ST-8A2 is a refit designed to enhance the Mech's utility as a bodyguard for Command lances. A class D refit, the 8A2 replaces the standard Medium Pulse Lasers with standard Medium Lasers. The free tonnage this creates is used to install a Beagle Active Probe and upgrade the Small Laser to a Pulse model.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Upper</color>",
